#: colorpickerconfigpage.cpp:34
#, kde-format
msgid "Show preview for known color names"
msgstr "Monstrar vista preliminar per nomines de color cognoscite"

#: colorpickerconfigpage.cpp:36
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Also show the color picker for known color names (e.g. skyblue).\n"
"See https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-4/#named-colors for the list of colors."
msgstr ""
"Etiam monstra le selector de colores pro nomines de colores cognoscite (p."
"ex. skyblue). Vide https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-4/#named-colors pro le "
"lista de colores."

#: colorpickerconfigpage.cpp:39
#, kde-format
msgid "Place preview after text color"
msgstr "Pone vista preliminar postea color de texto"

